--- !u!114 &935799389
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 935799387}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'DIG SITE DISASTER

    Scan a marked plot to locate buried fossils and
    artifacts. Their real models stay underground until actual Digger PRO terrain
    is removed. Drive within boom reach and stop before operating. Tap your assigned
    ACTION to cycle SCANNER, EXCAVATOR, DRILL, BLOWER, BRUSH and LIFT; hold ACTION
    to operate. The TOOL buttons provide the same choice for each assigned owner.
    Large tools remove soil faster but damage nearby artifacts. Use the scanner height
    and exposure readout to switch to blower/precision brush near a find. All surrounding
    terrain must physically clear the real artifact before the hoist accepts it.
    The real crane lifts and places it on your truck''s cargo deck; after physical
    rest it is secured. Drive slowly into your numbered research reception. Actual
    reception scores the preserved value once, then the crane physically unloads
    it onto an exhibit bench. No score from scanning, digging or a loose dropped
    artifact. Each equal plot contains three finds; solo and up to four assigned
    people/AI use full original NWH driving. In Preservation Cup each crew owns its
    plot; Cooperative Exhibit shares active plots and total exhibit value. Rematch
    uses Digger''s actual terrain reset for identical fresh conditions. Pause lets
    the already-issued cutter frame finish, then freezes terrain and the world. Workshop
    save/load uses the standard shared save menu; Digger disk persistence requires
    a player build and is deliberately unavailable in Editor.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -7304394381272760782, guid: 8e8f97682e668e94cb30d2e6b8e13d84,
